  "formal_scope": {
    "ExtensionOrbits": "Eight declarations: actual stabilizer transport in an equivariant fiber, injection and single-base-orbit surjection of actual quotient maps, their equivalence and value; odd-period fixed-point argument and no fixed orbit for a commuting fixed-point-free involution. No finiteness or faithfulness is assumed in the fiber theorem; the final odd-period premise is explicit for every acting element.",
